Hands-on experience creating math models for certified real-money casino games;
Knowledge of market-specific gaming regulations, lab certification requirements or game math approval processes;
Experience with sports-themed or branded casino games, including products that combine sports content with casino-style mechanics;
Interest in innovation, prototyping and building scalable mathematical frameworks for a growing casino games portfolio.
OUR OFFER 

Shape the mathematical foundations of one of the most exciting and fastest-growing portfolios in sports entertainment, casino gaming and iGaming.
Create game math models that directly influence player experience, product performance and the commercial success of casino games played by audiences worldwide.
Collaborate with talented colleagues across Product, Game Design, Engineering, QA, Compliance and Commercial teams in a highly collaborative international environment.
Take ownership of mathematical models, simulations and balancing decisions for an expanding portfolio of innovative casino gaming experiences.
A challenging, rewarding and analytical environment where your expertise has a direct impact on products used around the globe.
Competitive salary and attractive benefits package. 
Individual learning and professional development opportunities. 
A vibrant, inclusive company culture with global collaboration and diverse communities. 
Corporate fitness activities and additional employee wellbeing programs. 
We believe great products are built by great teams working closely together. While we offer flexible working hours, this role is fully office-based, as we strongly value in-person collaboration, knowledge sharing, fast decision-making, and team connection. We see working together onsite as a key driver of innovation, learning, and success. Certain exemptions may apply depending on location — your local point of contact can provide further details.

Additional Information

The minimum monthly salary for this position is according to the Collective Bargaining Agreement. Overpayment will be considered depending on qualifications and working experience.

At Sportradar, we celebrate our diverse group of hardworking employees. Sportradar is committed to ensuring equal access to its programs, facilities, and employment opportunities. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to age, race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability, or status as a protected veteran. We encourage you to apply even if you only meet most of the requirements (but not 100% of the listed criteria) – we believe skills evolve over time. If you’re willing to learn and grow with us, we invite you to join our team!
